Vitriolites are winged, bat-like fiends. They carry weapons taken from elsewhere: one used a greataxe wreathed in flame, another a pistol, which it leveled at the [[Voice of Many]] and fired without needing to aim. They teleport into a fight once they have had time to regroup, and they go straight for whoever is most exposed.

The party fought two of them at once during the defence of the Voice of Many's chamber.
